{
    "word": "vivacity",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f8d3e1d2-da36-30c8-a452-11c8496302f5",
                "word": "vivacity",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f5e6c210-f1bc-494b-b02c-f9be45f12366",
                        "entry_id": "f8d3e1d2-da36-30c8-a452-11c8496302f5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "vivacities"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                        "entry_id": "f8d3e1d2-da36-30c8-a452-11c8496302f5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The quality or state of being vivacious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31a09194-1f10-4dcb-b5f3-745adfc5790a",
                                "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                                "text": "But reposed natures may do well in youth. […] On the other side, heat and vivacity in age, is an excellent composition for business."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83b782a8-ac1f-4be2-b82c-55104b21e279",
                                "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                                "text": "1738, David Hume, A Treatise of Human Nature, Book I, Part I, Section III. Of the Ideas of the Memory and the Imagination,\nWe find by experience, that when any impression has been present with the mind, it again makes its appearance there as an idea; and this it may do after two different ways: either when in its new appearance it retains a considerable degree of its first vivacity, and is somewhat intermediate betwixt an impression and an idea: or when it entirely loses that vivacity, and is a perfect idea."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "220011f4-0f18-4123-a314-7b04fb68c54b",
                                "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                                "text": "The one entertained me with her vivacity when I was gay, the other with her sense when I was serious."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1a41cdc-5a65-477a-a272-cf8d22551a2d",
                                "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                                "text": "In the name of truth and common sense, why should not one woman acknowledge that she can take more exercise than another? or, in other words, that she has a sound constitution; and why to damp innocent vivacity, is she darkly to be told, that men will draw conclusions which she little thinks of?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21b69d76-4fa3-4f0c-a0b0-8153ee84cfd2",
                                "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                                "text": "Some secret sorrow, or the brooding spirit of some moody passion, had quenched the light and ingenuous vivacity of youth in a countenance singularly fitted to display both […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06d79cf0-1b6a-4207-b553-6cd3925884d6",
                                "sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                                "text": "[…] an extraordinary observer might have seen that the chin was very pointed and pronounced; that the big eyes were full of spirit and vivacity; that the mouth was sweet-lipped and expressive; that the forehead was broad and full; in short, our discerning extraordinary observer might have concluded that no commonplace soul inhabited the body of this stray woman-child […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b478759-bba2-4de2-a6ec-9bec26241be8",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8d3e1d2-da36-30c8-a452-11c8496302f5",
                        "source_sense_id": "3273096c-b3e4-3c06-8592-c528dd5880ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "the state of being vivacious",
                        "target_lang_word": "vivacité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vivacité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f3e1a82-45bc-32b0-8603-2efb32680e1b",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Caractère de ce qui est vif ; animation, activité, promptitude à agir, à se mouvoir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "051ad169-4c82-452b-839c-975fd9ef9abf",
                                                "sense_id": "6f3e1a82-45bc-32b0-8603-2efb32680e1b",
                                                "text": "Le vent sauta au nord et le froid reprit avec une extrême vivacité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a37b9181-099a-3709-a6cb-a8244f383917",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manière de sentir prompte et animée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83b29644-aa8a-4284-86b3-c5f6f3567134",
                                                "sense_id": "a37b9181-099a-3709-a6cb-a8244f383917",
                                                "text": "La vivacité de l’esprit, de l’imagination. La vivacité des sentiments, des sensations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "382eef27-2528-405b-9754-2d35dab7da4f",
                                                "sense_id": "a37b9181-099a-3709-a6cb-a8244f383917",
                                                "text": "Dans le tumulte et la vivacité des passions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf2cca08-4ae3-33a1-bb4b-cf0a7d429bd8",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vivacité de caractère, disposition à s’irriter, à s’emporter facilement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f107596-24a2-46e4-8416-d16afac2457b",
                                                "sense_id": "cf2cca08-4ae3-33a1-bb4b-cf0a7d429bd8",
                                                "text": "Il a eu un mouvement de vivacité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b4abb54-2701-3748-8d1a-b5e613eda49f",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            ", Emportements légers et passagers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eb59902-cfc2-4eb2-be91-202889461f72",
                                                "sense_id": "3b4abb54-2701-3748-8d1a-b5e613eda49f",
                                                "text": "Il faut s’efforcer de réprimer ses vivacités."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4a0d876-cfd6-3c95-89c5-c0dcfd9ca37b",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ardeur, la promptitude avec laquelle une chose est faite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2ba7606-b836-4173-9086-839fef4ad3cf",
                                                "sense_id": "a4a0d876-cfd6-3c95-89c5-c0dcfd9ca37b",
                                                "text": "La vivacité du combat, de la dispute. Cela lui est échappé dans la vivacité de la conversation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c7825a2-a339-3bb8-9b4e-8549624e247b",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Éclat vif."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "181c0531-1877-45fe-bb52-c475fbb27ee2",
                                                "sense_id": "7c7825a2-a339-3bb8-9b4e-8549624e247b",
                                                "text": "La vivacité des couleurs. La vivacité du teint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88246c6e-ba61-476f-833b-a0e1411d69d4",
                                                "sense_id": "7c7825a2-a339-3bb8-9b4e-8549624e247b",
                                                "text": "Avoir de la vivacité dans les yeux. La vivacité du regard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64712da7-7a72-41c1-a58e-7570699592fc",
                                                "sense_id": "7c7825a2-a339-3bb8-9b4e-8549624e247b",
                                                "text": "avoir une physionomie pleine de vivacité"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f99b8c5a-81c1-3728-830e-67ea27a3f819",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Aptitude d’une poudre ou d’un chargement propulsif à brûler plus ou moins vite en fonction de la composition chimique et de la forme géométrique des grains ou des brins de poudre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Armement",
                                            "Matériaux énergétiques"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3a5b0fb-8a5e-3cd7-8050-4530eea1bd23",
                                        "entry_id": "7ebaaed1-1d40-3a59-be64-28b0a9ffa263",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualité d’un système qui garantit qu’une propriété sera inéluctablement vraie à partir d’une certaine étape de l’exécution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e29ea3bb-6fbc-43eb-9919-92084248233b",
                                                "sense_id": "e3a5b0fb-8a5e-3cd7-8050-4530eea1bd23",
                                                "text": "Soit un programme composé de p processus qui exécutent infiniment deux séquences d’instructions atomiques : une section critique (SC), composée de toutes les instructions consécutives d’un programme ayant besoin d’accéder à une ressource critique et une section non-critique (SNC). Le droit d’accès à la ressource critique est contrôlé par deux procédures Entrer(i) et Sortir(i) donnant ou libérant la ressource en exclusion mutuelle au processus i :\nEntrer(i) SC Sortir(i)\n[…]\nPour résoudre le problème de concurrence entre ces processus, une solution correcte doit satisfaire a minima les propriétés suivantes :\n— sûreté : au plus un processus peut être en exclusion mutuelle,\n— vivacité ou absence de famine : tout processus demandeur finit par entrer en exclusion mutuelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
